infographic sequence-snake-steps-underline-text
data
  title Conditions order is the contract: first match wins
  desc Node walks the keys top-to-bottom and takes the first match — not the most specific
  sequences
    - label types
      desc First — TS resolves at check time, before code runs; below import/require it matches JS and misses the .d.ts
    - label import
      desc ESM consumers (import / dynamic import()) get the .mjs build
    - label require
      desc CJS consumers (require()) get the .cjs build
    - label default
      desc Last — the always-matching catch-all; placed higher it shadows every condition below it
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
